WEBVTT

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.910
Keep up the good work.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:29.450
Your words honor me, Princess Altena.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.160
So that's Princess Buttocks, the girl who
showed the whole world her butt, huh?

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:43.040
They all call me Princess Buttocks
behind my back now!

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.040
And it's all because of...

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.120
Because of...

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:50.540
Because of that, they all call me...

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.830
Princess Altena...

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.830
Princess Buttocks!

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:56.750
G-Good afternoon.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:57.790
You, too?

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.500
Princess Altena, the demon beasts
are causing more damage by the day.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.870
We'd like to hold a conference
on how to deal with them...

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.620
All right.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:10.660
By the way, did you find
the man I summoned?

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.910
We're still looking currently...

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:16.330
Find him as soon as possible.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:20.000
Of course! Even if he is the hero,
to humiliate Princess Buttocks--

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.540
I mean, Princess Altena!

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:33.750
I'm sure you're upset,
but please be compassionate.

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:39.620
That's on him.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:44.580
I'll find you yet, Hero!

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:19.950
"Demon Beast x Part-Time Job"

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.950
"Shigure"

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:31.450
I need to fill three more boxes today...

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.200
Delicious!

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.620
They're high-quality, so...

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.620
Yes, they are. Here you go.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:57.910
Oh, no... You can't pay more?

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:02.040
Sorry, the economy's been bad lately.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.080
Let's go.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.410
Yes, sir.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.910
There you go! Eat up! Eat up!

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:18.000
This is really expensive food!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:22.250
Have another bowl!

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.250
Grow up big!

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:31.500
Let's try and take down a griffon, then!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.450
Yeah!

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.450
To our victory, and...

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.040
Have you decided, then?

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:43.330
Yeah. When we're done with the quest,
I'm asking her out.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:45.330
If I do, I know her dad will finally...

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.410
Yeah.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:48.910
That Genzo!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:53.080
We're broke but he keeps
bringing in more mouths to feed...

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:57.540
It's weird that he'd bring
other girls into the house.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:59.040
Who does that?

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:02.700
Really, he's such a softie.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:08.700
He's tricking you, Shigure.
You know that, right?

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:13.000
But I want to help him with his dream...

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.040
I want humans and demon beasts to coexist!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.330
I want to cheer him on.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:24.870
Hold it! You can't fill
your stomach with dreams.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:29.750
You need to scold them hard,
or men get lazy really quick.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.700
I love you.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.450
Please live in the same house as me.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:51.660
I want to live with you forever.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.410
What's your answer?

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:15.120
Do you understand my love, Akemi?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.450
Your name's Akemi now!

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:23.040
From here on out, we'll be together forever.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:28.080
Well done, Genzo!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:31.950
Genzo!

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:37.660
Hey... You're looking lovely today...

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.500
The way your neck curves is just so hot!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.040
Oh my, Genzo.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.830
You know I'm too old for you.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.750
That's not true at all!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:52.450
I want to bury my face
in your belly right this instant!

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:53.790
Genzo!

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:57.080
You should be saying that stuff to Shigure.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.120
I'm married, you know...

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:03.370
Your husband's a kobold, right?

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:07.700
I can love both you and
your husband at the same time!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.250
Miss...

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.910
Wait! I've got over 20 kids!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.790
Not another word.

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:18.950
Miss...

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.160
Miss!

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:26.040
What are you up to now?

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.370
Shigure!

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:29.120
Oh, Shigure!

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:33.910
Look! This is our new family member, Akemi!

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:44.750
Mistress... You mustn't...

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:49.160
No! Really!

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:56.660
Mistress... Good morning.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.200
Shigure, can I have some money?

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.250
First, look at this.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:06.450
My artistic talents can't depict
the mistress's incredible beauty!

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:10.700
So I want to hire a talented artist to draw her.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.870
And then we'll merchandise it!

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:19.120
We can share her beauty with
the whole world, and make a mint!

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:25.160
Shigure, look at this.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.660
Look at her eyes, like jewels...

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:32.500
Akemi needs a new bed,
and only the finest of cat food...

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:37.120
Toss.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.160
Wait, Akemi!

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.620
Don't go!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.120
Shigure!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:44.200
Where do you think we're going
to find the money?

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.500
Excuse me.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.120
I'm Clause with Cluster Bank.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:52.200
Today's the deadline.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.910
Don't mind me.

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:07.370
Do you have the down payment
for the loan we discussed?

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.000
I forgot.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.250
We don't have it!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:16.160
With all these people, you should be able
to get the money quick if you worked.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.750
I can't do that.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.410
Who will look after the kids?

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.290
Me neither.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:25.790
I'm not interested in working
for anyone but my mistress.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:30.290
Is there a job that involves only eating?

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.080
I see.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.870
So that loan will just have
to be off the table, then...

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:36.750
What?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.370
That's a problem...

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:40.950
Guys, we're off to work, now!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:42.870
Right now!

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:46.870
Why should I listen to... you--?

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.830
I said get to work!

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:52.040
I'll help, too!

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.200
I can't eat food without money!

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.500
Hanako! You finally...

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:01.580
You finally decided to work, all of you!

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.250
Okay, let's get to work!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:05.040
Yeah!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.830
Here's your order!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.870
"Winner of Eating Contest Gets Prize Money"

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.870
Here's your order!

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.250
Here's your order!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:23.370
"Winner of Eating Contest Gets Nothing"

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.370
Hang in there! We're almost there!

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.750
Y-Yeah...

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.830
Here's your order!

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:40.290
You're all so cute!

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.790
"Winner of Eating Contest
Has To Pay Normal Price"

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.790
You're fired! You're fired!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:56.160
How do we have less money
than when we started?

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:57.580
It was the strangest thing!

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.080
At some point, they started
charging me for food!

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.120
I tried to work!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.330
But when I went into town,

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:06.870
the men started asking me weird things,
like, "How much for a roll in the hay?"

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.160
Hey, is that...

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.620
I took their money and tried to leave,
and they chased me!

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.580
My boss was a jerk!

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:17.000
All I did was share my love
with these kids for a few hours,

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.660
and he fired me for no reason!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.290
Right, Shingen?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.160
Right, Genzo?

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.620
You brought home another one?

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.660
Gimmie yummy food!

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.290
Now! Food!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:35.250
Shut up before I yank your
feathers off, you stupid bird!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.620
Let me go! Stop, damn it!

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:39.410
You want to talk back, huh?

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:40.870
Shigure, calm down!

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:41.700
Shigure!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.660
I feel like chicken tonight!

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:45.450
Shigure, calm down!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:52.290
So we're at the point where we
can't afford food, let alone a pet shop.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:55.830
If you're in that bad of shape,
how about this?

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:56.950
This is...

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:58.950
The demon beast killer.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:04.250
The perfect job for Genzo,
the demon beast killer.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.040
A griffon?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.290
Yes. The guild master
recommended it personally.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.410
Look at this!

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:26.580
I'd love to track it down.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:30.700
Yes, let's track it down and get the bounty!

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:33.790
There seems to be a misunderstanding, maybe.

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:36.410
Let's ignore them, Mistress.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:42.250
With this much money,
we'll be back in the black in no time!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.540
And you can get your pet shop!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:49.250
So you're going after the same quest, huh?

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:53.870
But we'll be the ones to complete the quest!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.290
Behold!

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:00.790
This holy sword, Durandal,
given to me by the sage of the west!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:05.750
Demon beast killer, I'll kill the griffon
before you using this holy sword.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:09.660
Don't you dare kill it!

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:16.200
Oh? Did somebody else forget a sword?

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.660
Okay, Shigure, Hanako, Carmilla!

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.660
We're off to see the griffon.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:23.660
I refuse.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:28.410
Why do I have to obey a human?

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.410
Go by yourself--

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:32.410
I'll go, Genzo!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:38.330
I've never nibbled on a griffon,
and I can't wait!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:42.120
Do half-dragons nibble on griffons?

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:43.580
Let's go!

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.910
You can hold down the fort
by yourself, Carmilla!

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:49.540
That's right. I want my hands on that
bounty money as soon as possible.

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:50.250
Um...

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:53.250
That's right! Let's go meet
the newest member of our family!

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:54.700
Hey!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.620
Wait! I'll go with you!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:01.200
There's even more weirdos with him.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:01.200
Wait! I'll go with you!

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.790
Leave it to me, Mistress!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.290
She changed her mind quick.

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:14.080
I'll take down that griffon for you!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.790
Don't take it down!

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:20.750
Oh, no! My spine!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.330
Carmilla, that's an amazing
bend in your spine!

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:25.910
By the way, what kind of
demon beast is a griffon?

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:29.160
You took the quest without knowing?

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:33.330
I knew I could love it
the minute I saw the poster!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.450
Its personality and the other
details are secondary!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:37.700
You're a weirdo.

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:39.330
Here you go.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.910
Oh!

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:45.450
"Griffon. A dangerous beast
with A+ class combat capabilities.

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.160
Gives birth to two children at once."

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:52.200
You've gotten really good at reading, Genzo.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.790
My love for animals makes it possible!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.330
"The griffon makes its two children fight,

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.160
and only raises the winner."

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.120
What?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:06.410
It says the loser is abandoned
by its mother and dies.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:11.870
Griffons are no match for me and
my burning love for the mistress.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:13.120
Say that after you've stood up.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.750
Stand up first.

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:20.290
This place is a danger zone where
any demon beast can be found.

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:24.330
I think only stupid hunters, or hunters
with a death wish, come here.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:25.660
Like them?

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.040
That's them!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.290
That's pretty...

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.040
If it weren't for this sunlight,
they'd be no match for me...

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.290
It's cloudy, though.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:50.750
Oh, fine! Genzo, you can have
the glory from this quest.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.370
Hey.

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.790
My skull! My skull is bending!

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.160
So that's a griffon, huh?

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:02.790
What wonderful hair,
and such sharp beaks too!

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:05.450
Genzo, look!

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:11.410
That's what the book said,
about the children fighting!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.330
Genzo!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.580
Okay!

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.620
Let's run, everyone!

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:26.450
Okay!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.370
H-Hey!

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:32.700
What are you doing?

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:34.200
What do we do, Genzo?

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:36.120
The bell has rung!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:40.700
Now there's no need for this kid to be hurt!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.660
Genzo!

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.620
No, but...

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:47.700
She lost! So I can have her, right?

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.370
If you're just going to abandon her,
give her to me!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:53.000
So that was all you wanted?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.660
Carmilla!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.370
I have no choice.

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.290
Mistress, forget about me and run--

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:13.620
Genzo, Carmilla is...

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:15.120
Mistress!

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.410
...in big trouble!

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:18.750
She's done for. Let's leave her.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:21.540
I'm more worried about Kyoko!

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.200
You named it already?

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:27.620
Who's more important,
Carmilla or a griffon you just met?

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:33.080
She's got no tail, no animal ears,
she doesn't pay rent... Forget her.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:34.160
You meanie!

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:35.120
But look at her!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:38.410
The dazzling eyes, the beautiful beak!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.620
Kyoko will grow up to be beautiful!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:44.700
Stop being stupid and
give her back to her parents!

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.910
I refuse!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.410
I will raise Kyoko in a loving household!

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:51.540
I'm her real dad now!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.080
You...

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.250
Very well.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:01.700
Shigure!

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:03.450
Hold Kyoko for me.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:10.160
Hanako, get Carmilla back.
If you don't think you can, give up and run.

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:12.830
No, I won't run!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.660
Look!

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:20.080
When I look at that plump meat,
I can't control myself...

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:25.830
I'll hold them down, so Shigure,
take Kyoko home!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.080
No...

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.160
I can't run by myself!

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:31.410
If you escape safely with her,

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:34.330
you can put some meat or vegetables
in our soup tonight.

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.580
Leave it to me!

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:39.200
I'm so tired of soup that's just salty water.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:43.040
Let's go! Come and get me!

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:44.330
Go, Shigure!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.370
Right!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.000
Genzo!

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:53.000
Come on!

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:00.620
How are you so tough?

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:05.120
Because... I train hard!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:10.200
I was waiting for this moment!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.080
You've got his head!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:16.040
Now counterattack!

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.790
This fur is so soft!

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:29.000
It's like a cross between a bird's
feathers and an animal's coat!

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.500
It feels so weird!

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.660
It's great!

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:35.200
Now to feel up your chest!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.200
Genzo!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.700
How could you?!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.370
Breast meat. Thigh meat.

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:54.080
Belly meat. Leg meat.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:56.750
I can't hold back anymore!

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:11.160
I'm back!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:15.750
I'm so glad you made it back safe!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:21.370
I took a bite out of the griffon
and it wasn't delicious, so we ran.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:23.870
I see.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.620
What's he doing?

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:32.200
Carmilla comes back to life faster
if she sleeps in impure soil.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:41.700
We didn't beat the griffon,
so we didn't get the reward.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.540
But...

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:52.200
The food costs...

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.870
Kyoko!

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:56.410
You grew up so big, Kyoko!

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:58.120
Too big!

00:20:58.120 --> 00:20:59.910
Her fur is the best...

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:02.040
But the food costs, Genzo...

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.040
Get even bigger!

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:06.450
Please no!

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:06.450
Get even bigger!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:12.330
Genzo brought a new girl home.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.250
Another! That jerk!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:16.790
Weren't you going to scold him?

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:21.200
I think that's part of his charm, though...

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:22.910
This is going nowhere.

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:25.330
You haven't got any money, though, right?

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:29.000
Actually, I've been bringing in
some cash lately.

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:35.160
This is the magic sword, Dainsleif,
and the holy sword, Durandal!

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:38.910
Where did you get these incredible rare items?

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:43.080
I must have good luck, because
I just find them lying around!

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:45.080
Here's your money for this time.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:47.330
Come back soon, missy!

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:50.080
Sure thing!

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:34.410
I see. A human hero.

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:39.160
Yes. Our preparations are complete,

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:40.950
Lady Joanna.

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:49.790
Next time: "Animal Mask x MAO."
